# J. Jonah Jameson's enter trigger may target any creature, JJJ himself included: he becomes suspected and has menace. When he attacks on turn 5 ("Whenever a creature you control with menace attacks") Bot1 creates one Treasure token. Bot2's Memnite is not suspected.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
J. Jonah Jameson
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.J. Jonah Jameson.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(J. Jonah Jameson)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.J. Jonah Jameson.Suspected = true
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(J. Jonah Jameson > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield = J. Jonah Jameson; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Treasure Token
